WEBVTT

00:01:59.236 --> 00:02:03.316
but also very much
because of my wheelchair.

00:02:04.196 --> 00:02:07.076
It literally has made
all of this possible.

00:02:08.196 --> 00:02:10.036
I’m independent with my chair.

00:02:10.756 --> 00:02:13.916
I’m free to go wherever I want to.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:17.636
I’m able to do things
I couldn’t otherwise.

00:02:19.076 --> 00:02:24.116
My motorized wheelchair gives me three
incredibly important things:

00:02:24.116 --> 00:02:25.756
freedom,

00:02:25.756 --> 00:02:27.356
independence

00:02:27.356 --> 00:02:28.356
and ability.